      <gram>Производное с суф.-ica от<ref type="etymon" target="granb-2">*granb</ref> 
(см. 
<ref type="etymon" target="grana">*grana</ref>\<ref type="etymon" target="gra">*gra</ref>№\<ref type="etymon" target="gran">*gran</ref>\&gt;).</gram>
    </gramGrp>
  </entry>
